# Copy this file to .env for local testing (never commit the real .env).
# On Render, set this as an Environment Variable in the dashboard instead of a file.

# A secret string you make up yourself. Roblox must send this in the
# x-api-key header on every request, so randoms who find your server URL
# can't spam it into generating cards. Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 24
API_TOKEN=

# Note: no Discord webhook URL lives here anymore. This server only generates
# the card image and hands back a URL to it — Roblox posts to Discord itself
# (see the roblox/ notes in the README). That's a deliberate workaround for
# Discord/Cloudflare blocking direct webhook posts from some hosting IPs.
